#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:8
msgid ""
"Ship a builtin `minacode-help` skill with an offline manual, "
"troubleshooting guidance, a matching-version source inspection fallback, "
"and an idle hint inviting minacode questions. Builtin skills use the same"
" discovery and loading path as ordinary skills; user and project skills "
"can override them by name."
msgstr ""
"内置 `minacode-help` skill，提供离线手册、故障排查指引、按匹配版本检查源码的后备流程，并通过 idle hint "
"提醒用户可以直接询问 minacode 问题。内置 skill 与普通 skill 使用相同的发现和加载路径；用户和项目 skill "
"可以按名称覆盖它们。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:12
msgid ""
"Add `max` reasoning effort and map normalized effort levels to each "
"documented provider/model family, including OpenAI GPT-5 and o-series "
"generations, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, Z.AI, OpenRouter, and "
"OpenCode Zen. Unknown providers and future model names retain generic "
"pass-through behavior, and `/config` now shows the resolved effort sent "
"to the active model."
msgstr ""
"新增 `max` reasoning effort，并按各个有文档依据的 provider/model family 映射标准化的 effort "
"级别，覆盖 OpenAI GPT-5 与 o-series "
"各代、Anthropic、DeepSeek、Qwen、Kimi、Z.AI、OpenRouter 和 OpenCode Zen。未知 "
"provider 与未来模型名仍保留通用透传行为；`/config` 现在会显示发送给当前模型的解析后 effort。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:16
msgid ""
"Add a `provider.builtin_tools` option (a list of tables, default empty) "
"appended verbatim to the `tools` array of whichever protocol the provider"
" speaks, so a provider's own server-side tools can be offered to the "
"model. This is how provider web search is enabled: `{ type = "
"\"web_search\" }` for OpenAI and Qwen on the Responses API, `{ type = "
"\"web_search_20250305\", name = \"web_search\" }` for Anthropic, `{ type "
"= \"web_search\", web_search = { enable = \"True\" } }` for Z.AI, and `{ "
"type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }` for OpenRouter. Entries are passed "
"through unchanged after a check for a non-empty `type` and against the "
"provider's documented wire. Enabling an active entry changes the prompt "
"cache key, and `/config` distinguishes configured entries from the active"
" projection. One provider configures search through the request body "
"instead — Qwen Chat's `enable_search` — and continues to use "
"`provider.extra_body`."
msgstr ""
"新增 `provider.builtin_tools` 选项（table 列表，默认为空），将其原样追加到 Provider 所用协议的 "
"`tools` 数组，使模型可使用 Provider 自己的服务端工具。Provider 联网搜索的配置方式包括：OpenAI 和 Qwen "
"Responses API 使用 `{ type = \"web_search\" }`，Anthropic 使用 `{ type = "
"\"web_search_20250305\", name = \"web_search\" }`，Z.AI 使用 `{ type = "
"\"web_search\", web_search = { enable = \"True\" } }`，OpenRouter 使用 `{ "
"type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }`。条目会在检查非空 `type` 和 Provider 文档规定的 wire"
" 后原样透传。启用且实际生效的工具会改变 prompt cache key，`/config` 会区分已配置条目和当前生效的投影。Qwen Chat 的搜索通过请求体中的 "
"`enable_search` 配置，继续使用 `provider.extra_body`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:26
msgid ""
"Scope known `provider.builtin_tools` entries to their documented request "
"wire. Responses-only entries (OpenAI, Qwen) are omitted on Chat or "
"Anthropic, Anthropic server tools only travel over Messages, and "
"Z.AI/Kimi Chat entries only over Chat. Incompatible entries remain "
"configured and become active again after switching back, so a shared "
"provider configuration works across models without destructive edits; "
"`/api` and `/config` report when they are inactive. On an active wire, "
"known providers still reject unsupported entries (for example Qwen "
"`code_interpreter` or Anthropic `web_fetch_*`) before SDK I/O, so "
"approval, file, container, and client-callback lifecycles cannot leak "
"through. OpenRouter server tools (`openrouter:web_search`, "
"`openrouter:web_fetch`, `openrouter:datetime`) are supported; DeepSeek, "
"Kimi Code, and OpenCode activate none. Unknown hosts and future tool "
"shapes on unknown hosts keep generic pass-through."
msgstr ""
"将已知 `provider.builtin_tools` 条目限定在其文档规定的请求 wire。OpenAI、Qwen 的 Responses "
"条目不会发往 Chat 或 Anthropic；Anthropic 服务端工具只发往 Messages；Z.AI/Kimi Chat 条目只发往 "
"Chat。不兼容的条目仍保留在配置中，切换回来后会重新生效，因此同一 Provider 配置可服务使用不同 wire 的模型，无须删除设置；"
"`/api` 和 `/config` 会报告条目处于 inactive 状态。在正确 wire 上，已知 Provider 仍会在 SDK I/O "
"前拒绝不支持的条目，例如 Qwen `code_interpreter` 或 Anthropic `web_fetch_*`，避免批准、文件、容器和"
"客户端回调生命周期泄漏。已支持 OpenRouter 的 `openrouter:web_search`、`openrouter:web_fetch` 和 "
"`openrouter:datetime`；DeepSeek、Kimi Code 与 OpenCode 不会激活任何此类条目。未知 host "
"及其未来工具结构仍走通用透传。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:36
msgid ""
"Log each provider-side tool call the provider reports line, and show it "
"as a running status phase while it happens. The line is written from the "
"parsed response, so it appears with streaming on or off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:39
msgid ""
"Answer a provider's own builtin function calls, so Kimi's `$web_search` "
"(declared as `{ type = \"builtin_function\", function = { name = "
"\"$web_search\" } }`) completes instead of failing as an unknown tool. "
"The declared call is answered with its arguments verbatim, as that "
"provider's protocol requires, without confirmation or result storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:43
msgid ""
"Resume an Anthropic turn the provider paused mid-search (`stop_reason: "
"\"pause_turn\"`) by sending the message back unchanged, instead of ending"
" the turn on what looks like a complete answer. Each resumption counts as"
" one agent step, so it stays bounded by `max_agent_steps`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:46
msgid ""
"List the sources a provider-side search reported under the answer. "
"Sources are display only: the stored answer stays exactly what the model "
"wrote, and nothing extra replays to the provider."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:50
msgid ""
"Prevent a forced live-follow-up acknowledgement from retaining local tool"
" calls returned despite tools being disabled, which could leave invalid "
"history and make the next answer look duplicated. Provider builtin "
"functions that were still offered remain available."
msgstr ""
"修复强制 live follow-up 确认在禁用本地工具时仍保留 Provider 返回的本地工具调用，导致历史无效、下一条回答看似重复的问题。"
"请求中仍有提供的 Provider builtin function 不受影响。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid ""
"Promote completed streamed text before provider-side tool output, so "
"Responses web search and Anthropic server-tool activity no longer make "
"the answer preview disappear before final output."
msgstr ""
"在 Provider 端工具输出前提升已经完成的流式文本，避免 Responses 联网搜索和 Anthropic 服务端工具活动使回答预览在最终输出前消失。"

