#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid ""
"Close each turn with a single full-width gray rule carrying its duration "
"(`done in 1m05s ─────…`) instead of the plain `[done in 1m5s]` line. The "
"label sits at the left of the rule rather than centered, and a blank line"
" lifts the rule off the answer. It is the turn's only horizontal rule: "
"the full-width rule that used to open the answer is gone, so a turn no "
"longer shows two rules. The duration reuses the working divider's "
"`elapsed_since` format, so the rule reads like the divider's final frame "
"(`5s`, `1m05s`) instead of `0m5s` / `1m5s`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:62
msgid "0.18.0 - 2026-07-31"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:65
msgid ""
"Add test-only OpenAI behavior emulation for Chat Completions and "
"Responses, including implicit user/tool breakpoints, exact-prefix cache "
"reads, and cache-write accounting."
msgstr ""
"新增仅用于测试的 OpenAI 行为模拟，覆盖 Chat Completions 和 Responses，包括隐式 user/tool "
"breakpoint、精确前缀 cache read 和 cache write 统计。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:67
msgid ""
"Let `Note` view selected working-state fields, and let `RecallContext` "
"list compacted history segments with pagination in addition to retrieving"
" and searching them."
msgstr ""
"`Note` 新增查看指定工作状态字段；`RecallContext` 除取回和搜索外，还可分页列出 compacted history "
"segment。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:69
msgid ""
"Gate idle input tips on feature availability (`$skill` only with skills "
"installed, `@server.tool` only with an MCP server connected), add `Paste "
"an image path to attach it` and a `/ps lists background jobs` tip that "
"appears while a job runs, and re-roll the tip each turn instead of "
"pinning one for the whole session."
msgstr ""
"空闲输入提示按功能可用性过滤（`$skill` 仅在安装了 skill 时出现，`@server.tool` 仅在连接了 MCP "
"服务器时出现），新增 `Paste an image path to attach it` 以及后台任务运行时出现的 `/ps lists "
"background jobs` 提示，并改为每轮重新随机抽取提示，而非整个 session 固定一个。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:73
msgid ""
"Let `Shift-Tab` reverse-cycle the offered next-step chips at the idle "
"prompt, mirroring `Tab`."
msgstr "在空闲提示处用 `Shift-Tab` 反向循环切换建议的下一步 chip，与 `Tab` 对称。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:76
msgid ""
"Make model context append-only between compactions: remove the rebuilt "
"per-request Memory and history-index blocks, retain Note changes as tool "
"history, and emit one complete working-state checkpoint when compaction "
"starts a new cache epoch."
msgstr ""
"Compaction 之间的模型 context 改为 append-only：移除每次请求重建的 Memory 和 history-index "
"块，将 Note 变更保留为工具历史，并在 compaction 开启新 cache epoch 时输出一个完整工作状态 checkpoint。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:79
msgid ""
"Record session start and resume times in the user's local time with an "
"explicit numeric timezone offset. Resume is now a durable user-role "
"lifecycle event shared by Chat Completions and Responses; old snapshots "
"migrate through one complete state checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"使用带明确数字时区偏移的用户本地时间记录 session 开始和 resume 时间。Resume 现在是 Chat Completions 与 "
"Responses 共用的持久 user-role 生命周期事件；旧快照通过一次完整状态 checkpoint 迁移。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:82
msgid ""
"Show provider-reported cache-write tokens alongside cache reads in "
"`/status`."
msgstr "在 `/status` 中同时显示 provider 报告的 cache-write token 与 cache read。"

