#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:448
msgid ""
"Add two-level hierarchy to CLI tool logs: indented tool calls are root "
"events, approvals/output/errors/stored results use dim tree guides, Bash "
"commands use a background-neutral GitHub Dark syntax palette, commands "
"are shown once, compact tools remain single-line leaves, and flushed "
"follow-ups use a `nano+` prompt."
