#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:456
msgid ""
"Show per-file addition/deletion counts in `/diff`, restore the previous "
"CLI view after closing it, and syntax-highlight non-Bash tool arguments "
"as well as Bash and Job commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:457
msgid ""
"Refine the agent prompt around read-first engineering judgment, concise "
"progress updates, review behavior, follow-up responsiveness, and using "
"background jobs for potentially long-running work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:460
msgid ""
"Keep transient approval state (`approval required` and `[Y/n or reason]`)"
" out of terminal scrollback after a tool decision."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:461
msgid ""
"Follow edited files across unambiguous Bash moves so `/diff` reports "
"their final paths and logical net changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:462
msgid ""
"Prevent transient working dividers from leaking into CLI history during "
"Bash previews and approval handoffs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:463
msgid "Prioritize queued follow-ups when building the next model request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:464
msgid ""
"Keep Bash preview colors consistent, preserve literal closing-tag text, "
"show bounded output when no live frame is available, and avoid repeating "
"commands or output around live runs and failures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:465
msgid ""
"Coalesce capped fallback edits into one `/diff` entry per file, count "
