#~ msgid ""
#~ "Add a `provider.builtin_tools` option (a "
#~ "list of tables, default empty) appended"
#~ " verbatim to the `tools` array of "
#~ "whichever protocol the provider speaks, "
#~ "so a provider's own server-side "
#~ "tools can be offered to the model."
#~ " This is how provider web search "
#~ "is enabled: `{ type = \"web_search\" "
#~ "}` for OpenAI and Qwen on the "
#~ "Responses API, `{ type = "
#~ "\"web_search_20250305\", name = \"web_search\" "
#~ "}` for Anthropic, `{ type = "
#~ "\"web_search\", web_search = { enable ="
#~ " \"True\" } }` for Z.AI, and `{"
#~ " type = \"openrouter:web_search\" }` for"
#~ " OpenRouter. Entries are passed through "
#~ "unchanged after a check for a "
#~ "non-empty `type` and against the "
#~ "provider's documented wire. Enabling an "
#~ "active entry changes the prompt cache"
#~ " key, and `/config` distinguishes "
#~ "configured entries from the active "
#~ "projection. One provider configures search "
#~ "through the request body instead — "
#~ "Qwen Chat's `enable_search` — and "
#~ "continues to use `provider.extra_body`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "新增 `provider.builtin_tools` 选项（table "
#~ "列表，默认为空），将其原样追加到 Provider 所用协议的 `tools` "
#~ "数组，使模型可使用 Provider 自己的服务端工具。Provider "
#~ "联网搜索的配置方式包括：OpenAI 和 Qwen Responses API "
#~ "使用 `{ type = \"web_search\" }`，Anthropic"
#~ " 使用 `{ type = \"web_search_20250305\", "
#~ "name = \"web_search\" }`，Z.AI 使用 `{ "
#~ "type = \"web_search\", web_search = {"
#~ " enable = \"True\" } }`，OpenRouter 使用"
#~ " `{ type = \"openrouter:web_search\" "
#~ "}`。条目会在检查非空 `type` 和 Provider 文档规定的 wire"
#~ " 后原样透传。启用且实际生效的工具会改变 prompt cache key，`/config`"
#~ " 会区分已配置条目和当前生效的投影。Qwen Chat 的搜索通过请求体中的 "
#~ "`enable_search` 配置，继续使用 `provider.extra_body`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Scope known `provider.builtin_tools` entries "
#~ "to their documented request wire. "
#~ "Responses-only entries (OpenAI, Qwen) are"
#~ " omitted on Chat or Anthropic, "
#~ "Anthropic server tools only travel over"
#~ " Messages, and Z.AI/Kimi Chat entries "
#~ "only over Chat. Incompatible entries "
#~ "remain configured and become active "
#~ "again after switching back, so a "
#~ "shared provider configuration works across "
#~ "models without destructive edits; `/api` "
#~ "and `/config` report when they are "
#~ "inactive. On an active wire, known "
#~ "providers still reject unsupported entries "
#~ "(for example Qwen `code_interpreter` or "
#~ "Anthropic `web_fetch_*`) before SDK I/O, "
#~ "so approval, file, container, and "
#~ "client-callback lifecycles cannot leak "
#~ "through. OpenRouter server tools "
#~ "(`openrouter:web_search`, `openrouter:web_fetch`, "
#~ "`openrouter:datetime`) are supported; DeepSeek, "
#~ "Kimi Code, and OpenCode activate none."
#~ " Unknown hosts and future tool shapes"
#~ " on unknown hosts keep generic "
#~ "pass-through."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "将已知 `provider.builtin_tools` 条目限定在其文档规定的请求 "
#~ "wire。OpenAI、Qwen 的 Responses 条目不会发往 Chat "
#~ "或 Anthropic；Anthropic 服务端工具只发往 Messages；Z.AI/Kimi"
#~ " Chat 条目只发往 Chat。不兼容的条目仍保留在配置中，切换回来后会重新生效，因此同一 "
#~ "Provider 配置可服务使用不同 wire 的模型，无须删除设置；`/api` 和"
#~ " `/config` 会报告条目处于 inactive 状态。在正确 wire "
#~ "上，已知 Provider 仍会在 SDK I/O 前拒绝不支持的条目，例如"
#~ " Qwen `code_interpreter` 或 Anthropic "
#~ "`web_fetch_*`，避免批准、文件、容器和客户端回调生命周期泄漏。已支持 OpenRouter 的 "
#~ "`openrouter:web_search`、`openrouter:web_fetch` 和 "
#~ "`openrouter:datetime`；DeepSeek、Kimi Code 与 OpenCode"
#~ " 不会激活任何此类条目。未知 host 及其未来工具结构仍走通用透传。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Add `provider.builtin_tools` for provider-"
#~ "hosted tools such as web search. "
#~ "Configuration examples cover OpenAI, Qwen, "
#~ "Anthropic, Z.AI, Kimi, and OpenRouter, "
#~ "and `/config` shows whether configured "
#~ "tools are active."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "新增 `provider.builtin_tools`，用于联网搜索等 Provider "
#~ "托管的工具。配置示例覆盖 OpenAI、Qwen、Anthropic、Z.AI、Kimi 和 "
#~ "OpenRouter；`/config` 会显示已配置的工具是否生效。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keep builtin tool settings when "
#~ "switching to an API that does not"
#~ " support them. The tools remain "
#~ "inactive until switching back, while "
#~ "unsupported entries on a compatible API"
#~ " still report an error before the "
#~ "request is sent."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "切换到不支持 builtin tools 的 API "
#~ "时保留相关设置。这些工具会暂时停用，切换回来后重新生效；若当前 API 支持 builtin "
#~ "tools 但条目本身不受支持，则仍会在发送请求前报错。"
